      "message": "There is no standard set of SMCCC error codes as far as I can see. The Arm Architecture Calls use one set of error codes, PSCI uses a different set, the TRNG uses a different set, and so on. This enum is for the error codes returned by the KVM HVC calls, so I think `KvmError` is a good name for it.",
